OL,3,CEdinburgh festivals 'send clear
OL,4,Cmessage Scotland is a welcoming
OL,5,Ccountry'
OL,7,FEdinburgh's festivals are sending a
OL,8,Fclear message that Scotland is an open
OL,9,Fand welcoming country, the Deputy
OL,10,FFirst Minister said.
OL,12,FJenny Gilruth, who is also Scotland's
OL,13,FFinance Secretary, said the city's
OL,14,Ffestivals will provide the country's
OL,15,Ftalent with a "global platform" to
OL,16,Fshowcase their work.
OL,18,FShe will attend the opening concert of
OL,19,Fthe Edinburgh International Festival
OL,20,Fon Saturday night alongside public
OL,21,Ffinance minister Hannah Mary Goodlad.
OL,26,@wD@OOUwD@_O]
