OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786148289
OL,3,CEdinburgh festivals 'send clear
OL,4,Cmessage Scotland is a welcoming
OL,5,Ccountry'
OL,7,FMs Gilruth said: "Edinburgh's
OL,8,Ffestivals provide a global platform
OL,9,Ffor Scotland and for all the talented
OL,10,Fperformers who take part.
OL,12,F"They also bring hundreds of thousands
OL,13,Fof visitors to the capital throughout
OL,14,FAugust with all the economic benefits
OL,15,Fthat brings.
OL,26,@oD@ROUtD@AOU
