CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786148289
OL,3,CEdinburgh festivals 'send clear
OL,4,Cmessage Scotland is a welcoming
OL,5,Ccountry'
OL,7,F"They are invaluable for Scottish
OL,8,Fartists and performers to develop and
OL,9,Fsupport their ambition and creativity,
OL,10,Fproviding opportunities to showcase
OL,11,Ftheir work nationally and
OL,12,Finternationally.
OL,14,F"These festivals also send out a clear
OL,15,Fmessage that Scotland is an open and
OL,16,Fwelcoming country, reinforcing how the
OL,17,Fculture and arts sector occupy such an
OL,18,Fimportant place at the heart of our
OL,19,Fnational identity.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
