OL,3,CEdinburgh festivals 'send clear
OL,4,Cmessage Scotland is a welcoming
OL,5,Ccountry'
OL,7,F"Increasing investment into
OL,8,FEdinburgh's Festivals forms part of
OL,9,Fthe Scottish Government's commitment
OL,10,Fto increase culture funding by #100
OL,11,Fmillion annually by 2028-29, ensuring
OL,12,Fthe benefits and chances to
OL,13,Fparticipate are enjoyed across the
OL,14,Fcountry.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
