OL,3,CEdinburgh festivals 'send clear
OL,4,Cmessage Scotland is a welcoming
OL,5,Ccountry'
OL,7,F"I am delighted to be attending the
OL,8,Fopening concert of this year's
OL,9,FEdinburgh International Festival and
OL,10,Fthank everyone involved in the
OL,11,Ftremendous range of shows on offer
OL,12,Facross all the festivals in the city
OL,13,Fthis month."
